# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values.
**Never commit `.env.local`** — it is gitignored.

```bash
cp .env.local.example .env.local
```

---

## Supabase

# Your Supabase project URL (visible in: Project Settings → API → Project URL)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co

# Public anon key — safe to expose to the browser (Row Level Security enforces access)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# Service-role key — server-side only, bypasses RLS. NEVER expose to the client.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key_here

## Razorpay (test mode only — no KYC required for rzp_test_* keys)

RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_your_key_id_here
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=your_razorpay_test_key_secret_here
# Webhook secret — NOT the same as KEY_SECRET.
# Set in: Razorpay Dashboard → Settings → Webhooks → your endpoint → Secret.
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_razorpay_webhook_secret_here

## Mandate signing keypair (generated in Phase 1 via `npm run generate-keys`)

MANDATE_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=base64_encoded_ed25519_private_key_placeholder
MANDATE_SIGNING_PUBLIC_KEY=base64_encoded_ed25519_public_key_placeholder

## OpenAI API Key (Phase 7 - Natural Language Mandates)

OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
